  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Airlink Deliver Aid - Afghanistan Earthquake</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airlink is coordinating with our global network of nonprofit relief partners and airline and logistics partners to respond to the deadly Afghanistan Earthquake. Immediate needs include: medical aid, WASH supplies, search and rescue teams, food aid, and shelter. Airlink&apos;s mission is to remove the high costs &amp; logistical challenges of transporting emergency humanitarian aid to more efficiently reach people in need. Your donation provides sustainable funding to secure/fund airlift &amp; logistics.</narrative>
  </description>
